{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"nextjs-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Next.js Snippets","description":"App Router pages, layouts, route handlers, server actions, metadata and data fetching.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"TypeScript","path":"snippets/typescript.json"},{"language":"JavaScript","path":"snippets/javascript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/typescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Page\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxpage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function ${1:Page}() {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <main>\",\n      \"      <h1>${2:Title}</h1>\",\n      \"      $0\",\n      \"    </main>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A page\"\n  },\n  \"Async server page\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxspage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default async function ${1:Page}() {\",\n      \"  const ${2:data} = await ${3:getData}();\",\n      \"  return <main>$0</main>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async server component page\"\n  },\n  \"Layout\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxlayout\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <html lang=\\\"${1:en}\\\">\",\n      \"      <body>{children}</body>\",\n      \"    </html>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A root layout\"\n  },\n  \"Metadata\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxmeta\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export const metadata = {\",\n      \"  title: '${1:Title}',\",\n      \"  description: '${2:Description}',\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Page metadata\"\n  },\n  \"Route handler GET\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function GET(request: Request) {\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.json({ ${1:ok}: true });\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GET route handler\"\n  },\n  \"Route handler POST\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxpost\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function POST(request: Request) {\",\n      \"  const body = await request.json();\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.json({ received: body }, { status: 201 });\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A POST route handler\"\n  },\n  \"Server action\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxaction\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function ${1:save}(formData: FormData) {\",\n      \"  const ${2:name} = formData.get('${2:name}');\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A server action\"\n  },\n  \"Client component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxclient\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use client';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"import { useState } from 'react';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export default function ${1:Counter}() {\",\n      \"  const [n, setN] = useState(0);\",\n      \"  return <button onClick={() => setN(n + 1)}>{n}</button>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A client component\"\n  },\n  \"Loading\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxloading\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function Loading() {\",\n      \"  return <p>Loading...</p>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A loading UI\"\n  },\n  \"Error boundary\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxerror\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use client';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export default function Error({ error, reset }: { error: Error; reset: () => void }) {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <div>\",\n      \"      <p>{error.message}</p>\",\n      \"      <button onClick={reset}>Try again</button>\",\n      \"    </div>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An error page\"\n  },\n  \"Dynamic route params\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxparams\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default async function Page({ params }: { params: Promise<{ ${1:id}: string }> }) {\",\n      \"  const { ${1:id} } = await params;\",\n      \"  return <p>{${1:id}}</p>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Params of a dynamic page\"\n  },\n  \"Fetch with revalidate\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxfetch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const res = await fetch('${1:https://api.example.com/items}', { next: { revalidate: ${2:60} } });\",\n      \"const ${3:data} = await res.json();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"fetch with caching\"\n  },\n  \"Link\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxlink\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import Link from 'next/link';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<Link href=\\\"/${1:about}\\\">${2:About}</Link>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Link\"\n  },\n  \"Image\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nximg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import Image from 'next/image';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<Image src=\\\"${1:/photo.jpg}\\\" alt=\\\"${2:description}\\\" width={${3:800}} height={${4:600}} />\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An optimized image\"\n  },\n  \"Middleware\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxmw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"import type { NextRequest } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.next();\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const config = { matcher: ['${1:/dashboard/:path*}'] };\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A middleware\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/javascript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Page\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxpage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function ${1:Page}() {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <main>\",\n      \"      <h1>${2:Title}</h1>\",\n      \"      $0\",\n      \"    </main>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A page\"\n  },\n  \"Async server page\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxspage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default async function ${1:Page}() {\",\n      \"  const ${2:data} = await ${3:getData}();\",\n      \"  return <main>$0</main>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async server component page\"\n  },\n  \"Layout\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxlayout\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <html lang=\\\"${1:en}\\\">\",\n      \"      <body>{children}</body>\",\n      \"    </html>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A root layout\"\n  },\n  \"Metadata\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxmeta\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export const metadata = {\",\n      \"  title: '${1:Title}',\",\n      \"  description: '${2:Description}',\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Page metadata\"\n  },\n  \"Route handler GET\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function GET(request: Request) {\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.json({ ${1:ok}: true });\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GET route handler\"\n  },\n  \"Route handler POST\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxpost\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function POST(request: Request) {\",\n      \"  const body = await request.json();\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.json({ received: body }, { status: 201 });\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A POST route handler\"\n  },\n  \"Server action\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxaction\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export async function ${1:save}(formData: FormData) {\",\n      \"  const ${2:name} = formData.get('${2:name}');\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A server action\"\n  },\n  \"Client component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxclient\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use client';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"import { useState } from 'react';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export default function ${1:Counter}() {\",\n      \"  const [n, setN] = useState(0);\",\n      \"  return <button onClick={() => setN(n + 1)}>{n}</button>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A client component\"\n  },\n  \"Loading\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxloading\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function Loading() {\",\n      \"  return <p>Loading...</p>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A loading UI\"\n  },\n  \"Error boundary\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxerror\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"'use client';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export default function Error({ error, reset }: { error: Error; reset: () => void }) {\",\n      \"  return (\",\n      \"    <div>\",\n      \"      <p>{error.message}</p>\",\n      \"      <button onClick={reset}>Try again</button>\",\n      \"    </div>\",\n      \"  );\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An error page\"\n  },\n  \"Dynamic route params\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxparams\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default async function Page({ params }: { params: Promise<{ ${1:id}: string }> }) {\",\n      \"  const { ${1:id} } = await params;\",\n      \"  return <p>{${1:id}}</p>;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Params of a dynamic page\"\n  },\n  \"Fetch with revalidate\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxfetch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const res = await fetch('${1:https://api.example.com/items}', { next: { revalidate: ${2:60} } });\",\n      \"const ${3:data} = await res.json();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"fetch with caching\"\n  },\n  \"Link\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxlink\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import Link from 'next/link';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<Link href=\\\"/${1:about}\\\">${2:About}</Link>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Link\"\n  },\n  \"Image\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nximg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import Image from 'next/image';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<Image src=\\\"${1:/photo.jpg}\\\" alt=\\\"${2:description}\\\" width={${3:800}} height={${4:600}} />\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An optimized image\"\n  },\n  \"Middleware\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nxmw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"import type { NextRequest } from 'next/server';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"  return NextResponse.next();\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const config = { matcher: ['${1:/dashboard/:path*}'] };\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A middleware\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Next.js Snippets\n\nApp Router pages, layouts, route handlers, server actions, metadata and data fetching.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 30 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| TypeScript | `nxpage` | A page |\n| TypeScript | `nxspage` | An async server component page |\n| TypeScript | `nxlayout` | A root layout |\n| TypeScript | `nxmeta` | Page metadata |\n| TypeScript | `nxget` | A GET route handler |\n| TypeScript | `nxpost` | A POST route handler |\n| TypeScript | `nxaction` | A server action |\n| TypeScript | `nxclient` | A client component |\n| TypeScript | `nxloading` | A loading UI |\n| TypeScript | `nxerror` | An error page |\n| TypeScript | `nxparams` | Params of a dynamic page |\n| TypeScript | `nxfetch` | fetch with caching |\n| TypeScript | `nxlink` | A Link |\n| TypeScript | `nximg` | An optimized image |\n| TypeScript | `nxmw` | A middleware |\n| JavaScript | `nxpage` | A page |\n| JavaScript | `nxspage` | An async server component page |\n| JavaScript | `nxlayout` | A root layout |\n| JavaScript | `nxmeta` | Page metadata |\n| JavaScript | `nxget` | A GET route handler |\n| JavaScript | `nxpost` | A POST route handler |\n| JavaScript | `nxaction` | A server action |\n| JavaScript | `nxclient` | A client component |\n| JavaScript | `nxloading` | A loading UI |\n| JavaScript | `nxerror` | An error page |\n| JavaScript | `nxparams` | Params of a dynamic page |\n| JavaScript | `nxfetch` | fetch with caching |\n| JavaScript | `nxlink` | A Link |\n| JavaScript | `nximg` | An optimized image |\n| JavaScript | `nxmw` | A middleware |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}